{"id":2859,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2025年12月4日，软件学院第20251303期研究生华彩讲坛邀请到百信信息技术有限公司副总裁，山西文化旅游职业大学副教授魏建英作“国产化算力的应用与创新”主题分享。讲座由副院长付东来主持，全体研究生踊跃参加。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xnRUJYU8CbMmvYn0llso7-iUmCYLzVaRLzLsL4LYLmTRMNC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPoSyYMkyYnRT7U4TkL4Q2UzUaU8W2M8CPLzWRMzQkoRWFMmWRnNVfL7nFLlUYn1b/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz7iLzGJqdPnx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11510&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D19242D9DC9B36FA40CBF7F112C56B82/62CFAA0D/1D2F\" vheight=\"244\" vwidth=\"182\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xnRUJYU8CbMmvYn0llso7-iUmCYLzVaRLzLsL4LYLmTRMNC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPoSyYMkyYnRT7U4TkL4Q2UzUaU8W2M8CPLzWRMzQkoRWFMmWRnNVfL7nFLlUYn1b/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz7iLzGJqdPnx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11510&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xUzCJboRvDoz67U0mvaU4LaolnVMzCaPMR9DMmQfnRNDMz70gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh7n1h2oky4LzCDol74LRvZUl-4MNl4L7QVMlCaoRLbU4WFMmLYLlCiLmfFLlMkLYb/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz7iLzGJqdPnx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11510&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4DFF831669A3078AB36E30FE5F0839C2/6321F520/1CB3\" vheight=\"244\" vwidth=\"183\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xUzCJboRvDoz67U0mvaU4LaolnVMzCaPMR9DMmQfnRNDMz70gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh7n1h2oky4LzCDol74LRvZUl-4MNl4L7QVMlCaoRLbU4WFMmLYLlCiLmfFLlMkLYb/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz7iLzGJqdPnx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11510&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xoRUJaozCDoR6VL087aUNUPU4CZnmGaYLmrfnR7iUm7iLm70gihFp2hmCIa0nkyDUSyPM1y4Ul-ZnNQkMm9YLm7PnNM7LRCbnzlaLll4LzVFUNLYMzLbozWFL8CaUYb/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz7iLzGJqdPnx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11510&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D6A163AB8FFB682211FCD069E501E311/BC253992/3F0C\" vheight=\"253\" vwidth=\"338\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xoRUJaozCDoR6VL087aUNUPU4CZnmGaYLmrfnR7iUm7iLm70gihFp2hmCIa0nkyDUSyPM1y4Ul-ZnNQkMm9YLm7PnNM7LRCbnzlaLll4LzVFUNLYMzLbozWFL8CaUYb/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz7iLzGJqdPnx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11510&e=.jpg\"></p><p>讲座中，魏教授以2012年AlexNet模型为案例，对比了CPU与GPU在AI图像识别中的算力差异，直观展现了智能算力对AI技术的推动作用。魏教授指出：算法、算力和数据是智能化三要素，而2012年正是智能算力规模化应用的关键节点；他进一步拆解“算力”概念，指出基础算力、智能算力、超算算力的不同衡量标准。针对国产算力技术，魏教授对比了通用计算与AI计算的硬件架构，重点介绍了昇腾AI基础软硬件体系：从昇腾处理器、CANN异构计算架构，到MindSpore框架、ModelArts平台，形成了覆盖底层硬件到行业应用的全栈生态。讲座最后，魏教授结合“通用目的技术”理论，分析了信创产业的机遇与挑战，为师生清晰勾勒出国产智能算力的发展图景。</p><p>本次讲座将诺贝尔奖的基础研究与国产算力的产业实践相结合，既拓展了师生的技术视野，也加深了大家对信创产业的认知。</p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://ss.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xnRUJYU8CbMmvYn0llso7-iUmCYLzVaRLzLsL4LYLmTRMNC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPoSyYMkyYnRT7U4TkL4Q2UzUaU8W2M8CPLzWRMzQkoRWFMmWRnNVfL7nFLlUYn1b/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz7iLzGJqdPnx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11510&e=.jpg"}